g and Advancing Collaborative Design ...\n   URL: https://dl.acm.org/doi/10.1145/3706598.3713869\n   In product design, effective design space exploration (DSE) is crucial for generating high-quality design ideas, requiring designers to possess broad ...\n\n2. LLM-supported Exploration of the Program Design Space - arXiv\n   URL: https://arxiv.org/html/2503.06911v1\n   10 Mar 2025 · Program design, like other design activity, is characterized by navigating a space of alternative problem formulations and associated solutions ...\n\n3. The anchoring bias reflects rational use of cognitive resources\n   URL: https://link.springer.com/article/10.3758/s13423-017-1286-8\n   8 May 2017 · Cognitive biases, such as the anchoring bias, pose a serious challenge to rational accounts of human cognition.\n\n4. What is the anchoring bias? - Octet Design Studio\n   URL: https://octet.design/journal/anchoring-bias/\n   13 May 2025 · How to avoid anchoring bias? · 1. Comprehensive user research · 2. Regular usability tests · 3. User feedback · 4. Provide multiple perspectives · 5.\n\n5. Uncovering potential bias in engineering design: a comparative ...\n   URL: https://www.cambridge.org/core/journals/design-science/article/uncovering-potential-bias-in-engineering-design-a-comparative-review-of-bias-research-in-medicine/7633A8C5151ECF539FA8322E3B99B3CC\n   17 Jul 2023 · Bias can negatively influence decision-making, suggesting that it also negatively influences key processes in engineering design tasks such as ...\n", 'success': True}, {'tool': 'search_web', 'args': {'query': 'requirement analysis forcing function alternative solution generation', 'max_results': 5}, 'output': 'Search results for \'requirement analysis forcing function alternative solution generation\':\n\n1. Generate Alternative - an overview | ScienceDirect Topics\n   URL: https://www.sciencedirect.com/topics/computer-science/generate-alternative\n   4.5 Method for Generation of Alternatives To enable the optimizatio